[{"title":"福安书事 其五","author":"何乔新","text":"危樯巨舶昼纵横，海上时闻鼓角鸣。\n莫怪近来征税少，编氓渐入绿林兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安书事 其六","author":"何乔新","text":"青裙少妇抱孤儿，长跪车前泪满颐。\n夫死银坑生业尽，日锄野菜和糠炊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安书事 其七","author":"何乔新","text":"去年赈济仰官储，今岁官储半粒无。\n捕得海鲜将换米，可怜孤溆遇强徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安书事 其八","author":"何乔新","text":"儿钓青蛙母捕鳗，溪边风雨不胜寒。\n归来灶冷生柴湿，寂寞无言掩泪看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安书事 其九","author":"何乔新","text":"鸿雁嗷嗷可奈何，桑田此日变沧波。\n愿持诚意回天意，却转悲歌作笑歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安书事 其十","author":"何乔新","text":"茅檐过午突无烟，里正催租更索钱。\n不遇使君亲问讯，此身已分入黄泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山亭瑞香次宗源韵","author":"何乔新","text":"翠袖珠翘吐异香，不随群卉竞春阳。\n名园台榭今馀几，得似山亭晚更芳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"福安行台次景澄韵","author":"何乔新","text":"轺车晓驾粤山阳，苦雨萧萧去路长。\n最是不堪怊怅处，平原桑柘尽凋伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过大凝寺次景澄韵","author":"何乔新","text":"三年四度过禅家，两见凋零两见花。\n今日画轓重驻此，绿阴弥望尽桑麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初度有感时寓宁德行台","author":"何乔新","text":"五年初度客中过，不似今晨感最多。\n先垄在盱身在粤，蓼莪咏罢泪悬河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石牛驿次南谷韵","author":"何乔新","text":"苦雨炎风促去程，此心不为世间名。\n愿将几滴天瓢水，一洗闽山万壑清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讯鞫稍暇偶阅唐人王建宫词爱其寓兴深远颇得国风离骚之旨因拟作四章录呈易庵兼柬南谷年兄 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"花貌宫娃老掖庭，承恩元不在倾城。\n披香殿上开春宴，閒看群姬弄化生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讯鞫稍暇偶阅唐人王建宫词爱其寓兴深远颇得国风离骚之旨因拟作四章录呈易庵兼柬南谷年兄 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"憔悴无心对镜台，燕钗象揥锁尘埃。\n昭阳自有身轻者，肯放羊车夜半来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讯鞫稍暇偶阅唐人王建宫词爱其寓兴深远颇得国风离骚之旨因拟作四章录呈易庵兼柬南谷年兄 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"纤眉如月鬓如蝉，金屋栖迟十二年。\n别院昭容新系臂，而今已赐洗儿钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"讯鞫稍暇偶阅唐人王建宫词爱其寓兴深远颇得国风离骚之旨因拟作四章录呈易庵兼柬南谷年兄 其四","author":"何乔新","text":"碧梧淅淅送秋声，坐倚银床百感生。\n谁向御沟题落叶，不知沟水最无情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8643,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"汀州行台次易庵韵","author":"何乔新","text":"榕阴垂绿暗闽溪，蹀躞花骢去欲迷。\n驻节行台心独喜，幽林无复怪禽啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8644,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉华洞次易庵韵 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"白云深处是仙台，宝树春深玉蘤开。\n蓬岛未应能胜此，仙人何事不归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8645,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉华洞次易庵韵 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"洞前琪树倚云栽，洞里瑶华映雪开。\n一自飞軿游碧落，月明空见鹤归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8646,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道傍李花为风雨所残","author":"何乔新","text":"缟袂珠襦白玉冠，含悽无语怯春寒。\n东风不为多情惜，无数残钿趁马鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8647,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行部上杭道过三洲馆见白花生枳棘中芳洁可爱而不知其名问之村民曰文坛花也予哀其托根非所赋诗唁之又推花意而答赋焉凡得六首 其一 唁花","author":"何乔新","text":"雪彩冰姿傍棘丛，更堪苦雨与斜风。\n五侯亭馆多閒地，何事凄凉向个中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8648,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行部上杭道过三洲馆见白花生枳棘中芳洁可爱而不知其名问之村民曰文坛花也予哀其托根非所赋诗唁之又推花意而答赋焉凡得六首 其二 代花答","author":"何乔新","text":"素质生来异众葩，孤根不识五侯家。\n年年雨露随天分，肯向风前怨岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8649,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行部上杭道过三洲馆见白花生枳棘中芳洁可爱而不知其名问之村民曰文坛花也予哀其托根非所赋诗唁之又推花意而答赋焉凡得六首 其三 重唁花","author":"何乔新","text":"丽馆崇台二月时，群葩红紫竞葳蕤。\n可怜寂寞荒山里，空抱芳心吐向谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8650,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行部上杭道过三洲馆见白花生枳棘中芳洁可爱而不知其名问之村民曰文坛花也予哀其托根非所赋诗唁之又推花意而答赋焉凡得六首 其四 花重荅","author":"何乔新","text":"不誇颜色不誇香，不共群英竞艳阳。\n造化栽培知有意，且随本分过春光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8651,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行部上杭道过三洲馆见白花生枳棘中芳洁可爱而不知其名问之村民曰文坛花也予哀其托根非所赋诗唁之又推花意而答赋焉凡得六首 其五 再唁花","author":"何乔新","text":"沁园台榭五云连，铃索春来处处悬。\n何苦甘心萧艾里，炎风瘴雨有谁怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8652,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行部上杭道过三洲馆见白花生枳棘中芳洁可爱而不知其名问之村民曰文坛花也予哀其托根非所赋诗唁之又推花意而答赋焉凡得六首 其六 花再荅","author":"何乔新","text":"碧桃红杏炫春容，岁晚纷飞总是空。\n纵在主家铃索里，可能禁得五更风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8653,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渭水秋风图","author":"何乔新","text":"剪得秦川半亩云，晴窗凤羽翠纷纷。\n狂飙莫苦相摧折，清庙箾韶待此君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8654,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行台有花名剪春罗一夕盛开时浙寇入境予与景澄督兵讨之贼败走因戏成诗一绝云","author":"何乔新","text":"剑倚晴空杀气高，鼪鼯胆破抱弓嘷。\n天公应欲行勋赏，故剪春罗制绛袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8655,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"坐客有谈兵者纵横无穷谩成一绝以警之","author":"何乔新","text":"赵括谈兵世鲜伦，长平一败血成津。\n谁知蹙项安刘者，却是当时重厚人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8656,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过斜头遇雨","author":"何乔新","text":"肩舆薄暮过斜头，风雨萧萧送旅愁。\n太息人家生计尽，柴扉不掩野麋游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8657,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录村氓语 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"大儿前岁死银坑，弱子而今又出征。\n但愿使君平黠寇，老氓从此乐农耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8658,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录村氓语 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"行营昨夜运粮回，今日还差送甲来。\n道路奔驰何日已，石田强半是蒿莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8659,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过卧龙冈有感 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"卧看关河起战埃，草庐数语见雄才。\n于今未必无诸葛，谁肯三回枉驾来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8660,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过卧龙冈有感 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"铜臭纷纷位显庸，岂知王佐卧隆中。\n山林莫道无伊吕，冰鉴何人似德公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8661,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过卧龙冈有感 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"孝直奇谋世鲜双，君侯共事每包荒。\n忠勤亦有张枢密，却恨台章诋李纲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8662,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鳌溪图","author":"何乔新","text":"满榻松阴满院苔，书声隐隐蕙帷开。\n双桡谁鼓晴川艇，应是门生问字来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8663,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题屏间红梅","author":"何乔新","text":"曾饵仙人换骨丹，霞裳翠舞月华寒。\n暗香疏影终非俗，莫比桃花一样看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8664,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"一檄贤于十万兵，西南赤子荷更生。\n雄词谁似元夫子，重与磨崖颂圣明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8665,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"襄阳行遍到南阳，劳徕宁辞去路长。\n刁斗不惊鸡犬静，村居处处乐耕桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8666,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"总戎往岁驻荆襄，黄口呱呱泣路傍。\n今日欢然骑竹马，拦街歌舞迓都堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8667,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其四","author":"何乔新","text":"白茅覆屋竹编篱，斫得生柴给晓炊。\n妇子熙熙还感叹，于今始得免流移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8668,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其五","author":"何乔新","text":"绿林兵散瘴烟清，归买山田自力耕。\n荞麦收来村酿熟，家家歌吹颂皇明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8669,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其六","author":"何乔新","text":"荒山寒谷停车处，慰问丁宁出至情。\n白叟黄童俱感泣，不图今日睹升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8670,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录襄邓民言 其七","author":"何乔新","text":"玉节光临汉水湄，残民喜极更成悲。\n岘山何用铭遗爱，千载斯人口是碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8671,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食郊行书所见","author":"何乔新","text":"破帽飘飘白发垂，日斜醉饱意施施。\n归家尚作骄人态，不记墦间乞食时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8672,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"何乔新","text":"冰鉴当年重德公，近来何事大冬烘。\n人间未必无王佐，却认长蛇是卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8673,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅竹卷 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"梨云漠漠楚天低，缟袂相逢思欲迷。\n斗转参横寒漏永，梦回惟听翠禽啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8674,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅竹卷 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"姑射仙人冰雪姿，珠冠琼佩下瑶池。\n湘江帝子元同调，翠袖相依岁晚时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8675,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅竹卷 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"铁干琼英玉作魂，托根不傍五侯门。\n岁寒惟有疏篁在，共保清贞水石村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8676,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅竹卷 其四","author":"何乔新","text":"霜华簌簌暗香浮，万颗明珠夜不收。\n几度披图吟兴远，恍如水部在扬州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8677,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次吴原明韵","author":"何乔新","text":"故人寄我锦绷儿，要识淇园烟雨姿。\n却笑河豚誇绝品，此君真味有谁知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8678,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆汳台竹偶成","author":"何乔新","text":"汳水当年总宪时，翛翛半亩雪霜枝。\n别来久断平安信，劲节清风又属谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8679,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菊","author":"何乔新","text":"霜葩露叶冷香浮，别是人家一种秋。\n岁晏群芳摇落尽，翛翛翠筱伴清幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8680,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松为樊都运赋","author":"何乔新","text":"虬枝夭矫翠参天，雨干霜皮老更坚。\n榱桷年来收拾尽，岂知梁栋在山巅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8681,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋阳途次所见作 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"采采槐牙不满筐，妇姑踞地且同尝。\n祗愁四月槐牙老，从此贫家又绝粮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8682,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋阳途次所见作 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"阿母前行儿后追，儿追不及哭声悲。\n祗知各自求生路，肯复回头一顾儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8683,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋阳途次所见作 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"苜蓿花开松粉飘，贫家生计转萧条。\n平原处处无牟麦，山鸟休呼婆饼焦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8684,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋阳途次所见作 其四","author":"何乔新","text":"二八了鬟泣路隅，逢人但道乞为奴。\n岂知富室都悬罄，谁有馀粮养侍姝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8685,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋阳途次所见作 其五","author":"何乔新","text":"县令传言禁食人，谁怜百姓甑生尘。\n情知醉客非糟彘，且饱饥肠度此春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8686,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晋阳途次所见作 其六","author":"何乔新","text":"榆皮细捣昼丁丁，野菜同烝半熟生。\n幼稚呱呱羸老泣，不知何日见秋成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8687,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平陆所见","author":"何乔新","text":"被苫藉草倚颓垣，父啖儿尸祖啖孙。\n一段民风堪入画，写生只欠郑监门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8688,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"录村妪言","author":"何乔新","text":"卖却娇儿换豆归，岂知种豆尽为萁。\n空令骨肉东西散，不得杯羹疗母饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8689,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过故相第作 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"门掩西风昼不开，蛜蝛满壁粉墙颓。\n庭前乳犬休惊吠，无复怀金暮夜来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8690,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过故相第作 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"偃月堂空复道深，蔷薇零落棘成林。\n槎槎喜鹊归何处，不到人家送好音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8691,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白羊石","author":"何乔新","text":"白石离离似白羊，崭然头角遍沙场。\n独惭未学初平术，一任閒眠对夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8692,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"播州夜闻子规有感","author":"何乔新","text":"命堕殊方一羽轻，更怜十口住都城。\n播江此夜闻啼鴂，泪湿寒衾梦不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8693,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"事竣还京将发渝城偶成口号","author":"何乔新","text":"去岁乘轺出帝畿，兹晨整佩觐彤闱。\n担头讼牒兼诗草，不带川中一物归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8694,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居观物偶成作 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"风暖空庭草色青，门如市处不曾生。\n閒中玩物窥天意，始悟春风也世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8695,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居观物偶成作 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"双燕应怀旧主人，巡檐缉垒往来频。\n却嗟老圃春光暮，黄蝶纷飞过别邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8696,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居观物偶成作 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"风和日丽百花香，坐看游蜂酿蜜忙。\n扰扰营营空自苦，蜜成端的是谁尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8697,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居观物偶成作 其四","author":"何乔新","text":"灵乌噭噭集林端，浪惹群儿竞射弹。\n何似黄鹂逞娇舌，游人听罢有馀欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8698,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题泥金画梅 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"此花元是玉为容，金粉何劳点染工。\n识得和羹风味别，始知来自蕊珠宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8699,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题泥金画梅 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"琼姿不肯染缁尘，别是西湖一种春。\n画里底须论色相，金丸熟处见天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8700,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别同年王绣衣集句 其一","author":"何乔新","text":"我去君留可奈何，青云莫道故人多。\n片帆今夜又何处，独影翩翩逐逝波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8701,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别同年王绣衣集句 其二","author":"何乔新","text":"头上花枝照酒卮，凤城依约更相期。\n九重正尔思梁栋，可向江南久别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8702,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别同年王绣衣集句 其三","author":"何乔新","text":"杨柳青青江水平，别时相顾酒如倾。\n何当共剪西窗烛，更与慇勤唱渭城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":8703,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]